## Picture shapes for the line variants (thermo, whispers, renban, region sum …): hand-drawn named
## pictures plus procedural symmetric designs. The generator lays a picture on the grid first and then
## solves for digits that fit it (Generator._attempt_picture).
##
## A picture is [name, [path, path, …]]; a path lists its cells as "rc" (row, column, 1-based) in order,
## each step to one of the 8 neighbours. Paths may touch where one of them ends (a junction).

